      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MIDNIGHT GHOST (1) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing third (20.95) at this track over 365m. Top prospect. ZIPPING VIOLET (2) was below best at her last start when 6th at Wentworth Park following a third place finish (30.15) there two back. Has never been out of the placings from three starts out of this box. Better than last start and can bounce back. ALMOST STUNNING (8) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 20.71 beating Skedaddle Percy. One of the key runners again. FIREFLY GAL (7) is worth consideration after filling a hole at big odds last start.",
